# Local dev: copy to `.env` or `.env.local` and set VITE_API_BASE_URL.

# Base URL of the Expense Tracker API (no trailing slash).
# Example API Gateway invoke URL including stage: https://xxxx.execute-api.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/prod
VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# Production: copy `.env.production.example` to `.env.production` and set
# VITE_API_BASE_URL. From repo root, `./infra/deploy.sh` creates the bucket +
# CloudFront and uploads the build. From `expense-tracker-fe`: `npm run deploy`.
